  <!-- EN: Heavy combat mechanoids that glide on dozens of tiny legs. Their thick carapace and firepower makes them very effective against bunched-up static defenders，This type of centipede uses lighter armor and a dual mounted infantry magnetic rail weapon system, resulting in faster movement speed, but correspondingly, its resistance to attacks is also weakened. -->
  <Mech_CentipedeMRL.description>这是一种依靠数十条细小腿部滑行前进的重型战斗机甲。其厚实的甲壳和强大的火力使其在对抗聚集在一起的静态防御者时非常有效。这种蜈蚣型机甲采用更轻便的装甲，并配备双联装步兵磁轨武器系统，因此移动速度更快，但相应地，其抗击打能力也较弱。</Mech_CentipedeMRL.description>
